{"id":"n93425-1-9","stage":5,"title":"활기차다 · 充满活力","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93425-1-9-1","ko":"너 요즘 건강 음료 마시는구나.","zh":"你最近在喝健康饮料啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"건강","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}},{"text":"음료","meaning":"饮料","explanation":"음료：饮料","readings":[{"term":"음료","audio":"/audio/624e13a645f61b4ab37b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71112","senseId":"1","lemma":"음료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음료","audio":"/audio/624e13a645f61b4ab37b.mp3"}},{"text":"마시는구나.","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마시는구나","audio":"/audio/bce0c7f5b3dfe42da96c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"b9e697a6a3627e47","term":"건강","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3","entryId":"36670","definition":"指身体或精神没有异常、很结实的状态。","pronunciation":["건ː강"]},{"id":"624e13a645f61b4a","term":"음료","zh":"饮料","audio":"/audio/624e13a645f61b4ab37b.mp3","entryId":"71112","definition":"水或可以像水一样喝的液体。","pronunciation":["음ː뇨"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a9a8e6a1fef39bc1529f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n93425-1-9-2","ko":"응. 광고에서 이걸 마시면 활기찬 하루를 보낼 수 있대서.","zh":"嗯。广告上说喝这个就能拥有充满活力的日子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"광고에서","meaning":"广告","explanation":"광고：广告；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"광고","audio":"/audio/3ac16375aaf1de633847.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62390","senseId":"1","lemma":"광고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"광고에서","audio":"/audio/fd72f312216361cf662d.mp3"}},{"text":"이걸","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이걸","audio":"/audio/7f1cfc658d3e99fd2b27.mp3"}},{"text":"마시면","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마시면","audio":"/audio/0ebf111f176ad5de0c21.mp3"}},{"text":"활기찬","meaning":"充满活力，生机勃勃，元气满满","explanation":"활기차다：充满活力，生机勃勃，元气满满；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"활기차다","audio":"/audio/fe69fe8e35dcb47d2900.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93425","senseId":"1","lemma":"활기차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"활기찬","audio":"/audio/32775dbdfe4148b2d814.mp3"}},{"text":"하루를","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하루를","audio":"/audio/b850255244e28bafc718.mp3"}},{"text":"보낼","meaning":"度过","explanation":"보내다：度过；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"7","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보낼","audio":"/audio/5237e8ce24cf888c4462.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있대서.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；表示引用。","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；하다：表示引用。；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있대서","audio":"/audio/260c5897a3d61472e4ce.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"3ac16375aaf1de63","term":"광고","zh":"广告","audio":"/audio/3ac16375aaf1de633847.mp3","entryId":"62390","definition":"通过电视或报纸等向人们广泛告知某些信息的宣传活动。","pronunciation":["광ː고"]},{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"fe69fe8e35dcb47d","term":"활기차다","zh":"充满活力，生机勃勃，元气满满","audio":"/audio/fe69fe8e35dcb47d2900.mp3","entryId":"93425","definition":"充满力量，满满的生机。","pronunciation":["활기차다"]},{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"让时间流逝。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/be65275ee7a167f796fd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.217,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=93425","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。广告上说喝这个就能拥有充满活力的日子。","最近你和智秀学姐关系很好啊。","你最近在喝健康饮料啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯。广告上说喝这个就能拥有充满活力的日子。","你最近在喝健康饮